WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.180
Pronouns replace nouns to avoid repetition and must agree with who or what they refer

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:05.512
to.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.503
Replace Ama in “Ama sings well.” Answer: She

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:13.951
Rewrite a paragraph with repeated names using clear pronouns.

00:00:14.783 --> 00:00:17.194
Discuss why: She is a subject pronoun.
